x<10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt this point, we need to divide by $-5.$ However, because we are dividing by a negative, we also need to flip the signs of the inequalities.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5 & <-5x<10 \\\\ \\frac{5}{-5} & >\\frac{-5x}{-5}>\\frac{10}{-5} \\\\ -1 & >x>-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution can be written as $-1>x>-2$, but this is somewhat difficult to read because the larger number is on the left rather than the right. So, we will rewrite the solution by reversing the order of the numbers: \n\n$$\n-2<x<-1\n$$\n\nWe can represent this solution using a number line, as follows.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13944026/assets/91ec8574742229a2c7fd5af8920f9137e2b25e28a6f02a7cf1edcc8a4db4b6d5.png)" 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251101 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251102 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251103 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251104 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1000 #edb/ref 17592186251105 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1041 "selection" 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1104 #edb/ref 17592186251103 13194139533786 true] [17592186251100 1110 #uuid "748d7566-8b33-5499-a243-59208ab01908" 13194139533786 true] [17592186251101 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13944026/assets/1a3b83780bbd15328077dc45eef965aaf311e704990ee3cb45078d76c96183a2.png" 13194139533786 true] [17592186251101 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139533786 true] [17592186251101 1111 #uuid "cc553201-a411-5f67-8861-c683a5f2f038" 13194139533786 true] [17592186251102 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13944026/assets/c8c019b0d7a2b34e9791394ce1ac50f8db22b1d7fb9296a8c119a80a583d63ef.png" 13194139533786 true] [17592186251102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 1319